{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LLMFi6ad1ipRE62kSC97Xt","type":"tool_result","content":"1\ttransfer.create(source,destination,units,request_key), account.balance(account),\n2\treceipt.get(receipt). Account IDs belong to the current credential tenant.\n3\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d0e16908-5c13-4ccd-93b7-228adb46a35d","uuid":"616571c9-8610-4b1b-a421-93e9db8c3bc7","timestamp":"2026-10-26T05:28:04.769Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-mcp-review-ngx5fv1u/repo/docs/catalog.md","content":"transfer.create(source,destination,units,request_key), account.balance(account),\nreceipt.get(receipt). Account IDs belong to the current credential tenant.\n","numLines":3,"startLine":1,"totalLines":3}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01LLMFi6ad1ipRE62kSC97Xt","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQJ7aDr9VTZ8D813gzUe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GpKUPXGmd8fPDU2VAfzYFv","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-mcp-review-ngx5fv1u/repo/docs/client.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3725,"cache_read_input_tokens":14315,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3725},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d0e16908-5c13-4ccd-93b7-228adb46a35d","uuid":"76fb7824-d382-41c4-8e2a-af4d949544ff","timestamp":"2026-10-26T05:28:05.165Z","request_id":"req_011CgQJ7Zs1qKaJQe2icm36j","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01GpKUPXGmd8fPDU2VAfzYFv":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-mcp-review-ngx5fv1u/repo/docs/client.md"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GpKUPXGmd8fPDU2VAfzYFv","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Local host client\n2\t\n3\tservice.launch.build_host loads local service and host settings and a tool catalog.\n4\tIt keeps one registry across all local host sessions. open(token) returns an opaque\n5\tsession handle. tools(handle) returns discovery metadata. invoke(handle, packet)\n6\taccepts {id, tool, arguments}; a packet cannot supply a replacement credential.\n7\tThe saved credential is authenticated again for each invocation. batch executes\n8\tone to eight packets serially and returns each result or generic typed error.\n9\tThis local JSON-compatible packet API does not implement MCP wire negotiation.\n10\t\n11\thistory(handle, after, limit) returns the current subject's journal metadata in\n12\tits tenant. Journal fields contain argument names, never argument values or result\n13\tbodies. Shared subject credentials see that subject's history. Session expiration\n14\tand close remove the transport handle; they do not cancel owned application jobs\n15\tor undo completed operations. shutdown clears handles and stops further invokes.\n16\tRebuilding the host discards its registry and all local application state.\n17\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d0e16908-5c13-4ccd-93b7-228adb46a35d","uuid":"153f3945-e4ff-42a5-a699-d0ed0bbeb631","timestamp":"2026-10-26T05:28:05.172Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-mcp-review-ngx5fv1u/repo/docs/client.md","content":"# Local host client\n\nservice.launch.build_host loads local service and host settings and a tool catalog.\nIt keeps one registry across all local host sessions. open(token) returns an opaque\nsession handle. tools(handle) returns discovery metadata. invoke(handle, packet)\naccepts {id, tool, arguments}; a packet cannot supply a replacement credential.\nThe saved credential is authenticated again for each invocation. batch executes\none to eight packets serially and returns each result or generic typed error.\nThis local JSON-compatible packet API does not implement MCP wire negotiation.\n\nhistory(handle, after, limit) returns the current subject's journal metadata in\nits tenant. Journal fields contain argument names, never argument values or result\nbodies. Shared subject credentials see that subject's history. Session expiration\nand close remove the transport handle; they do not cancel owned application jobs\nor undo completed operations. shutdown clears handles and stops further invokes.\nRebuilding the host discards its registry and all local application state.\n","numLines":17,"startLine":1,"totalLines":17}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01GpKUPXGmd8fPDU2VAfzYFv","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
